["https://spdx.org/rdf/3.1/terms/Core/ExternalIdentifierType/ibrn", "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment", "[International Business Registration Number (IBRN)](https://ekys.org/business_identifiers/) is a unique identifier for legal entities standardized by [ISO 8000-116](https://www.iso.org/standard/75117.html). It is composed of two parts: a jurisdiction prefix and a local authoritative legal entity identifier (ALEI), separated by a colon. The prefix contains an ISO 3166 country code, an optional subdivision code, and a register code (e.g., `US-DE.BER:3031657`).", "http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString", "en", ""]
